The Laboratory (Lab) is the fourth {{Keyword|eternity|Eternity}} tab, unlocked by reaching [[Eternity#Animals Milestones|Animals Milestone]] 3 (own 7 [[Eternity#Animals|Animals]]).

The Lab allows the player to get Laboratory Points (LP), by purchasing 3 different upgrades which cost {{Keyword|ep|EP}}:

* Base (+0.20 per level)
* Mult (+0.50 per level) 
* Power (+0.01 per level)

(Some of these can be multiplied by other things eg. Base can be multiplied by supernovae, Mult can be powered by Wind {{Keyword|unity|Zodiacs}}, and Power can be multiplied by {{Keyword|dilation|DU9}}.)

The formula for LP/s is:  (Base x Mult) ^ Power

When enough LP has been generated to fill the flask on the center of the Laboratory page, the Lab level will increase and the player will gain a {{Keyword|rp|Research Point}} ({{Keyword|rp|RP}}).

{{Keyword|rp|RP}} can be used to upgrade 6 different Lab upgrades, as follows:

# [[Infinity|{{Keyword|ip|IP}}]] Gain (x4 per level)
# [[Revolution#Ascension|Ascend Power]] (*(1 + n*0.25) ''where n is level'')
# [[Infinity#Stars|Star Base Mult]] (*(1 + n*0.15))
# {{Keyword|ep|EP}} Gain (*(1 + n*0.5))
# [[Infinity#Generators|Gen. Power Exponent]] (+0.02 per level)
# Common Exponent (+0.01 per level, softcapped at level 500)

Each spent {{Keyword|rp|RP}} will increase a Lab upgrade by one level. Lab upgrades can be respecced at any time, removing all levels and refunding all {{Keyword|rp|RP}} to the player, at the cost of starting a new {{Keyword|eternity|Eternity}}. The most useful upgrades are #5 and #6, though later in the game, only use #6.

There are upgrades, {{Keyword|unity|zodiacs}}, and {{Keyword|eternity|milestones}} that give you free research levels for EVERY upgrade: {{Keyword|eternity|Animal Milestone}} 6 (get 48 animals), {{Keyword|eternity|Eternity Challenge Milestone}} 5, 6, and 7 (complete 30, 32 and 35 Eternity Challenges), {{Keyword|dilation|DU3}}, Eternity Challenge 7 reward, Dilation Tree Bottom-1 (makes {{Keyword|dilation|DU3}} stronger) and Bottom-2, and Aquarius.
